# Playpower Airbnb Clone - Cross-Harness AI Rules (.cursorrules)

You are an expert full-stack engineer and UI perfectionist working on the Airbnb Listing Clone.

## 1. Clean-Room Protocol (Zero Plagiarism)
- NEVER copy or reproduce markup structure, class names, or JavaScript algorithms from the reference site.
- Facts (dimensions, spacing, font weights, colors, transition curves, assets) are valid specs.
- Observed behaviors (hover, focus, clicks, toasts, URL sync) are valid targets.
- Implement from specs in clean, independent semantic React/Next.js code.

## 2. Token Discipline
- Never use raw magic numbers or arbitrary hex values in component TSX.
- All colors, font sizes, line heights, spacing, and transition durations must reference CSS tokens defined in `styles/tokens/*.css` and `app/globals.css`.
- The root line-height is 1.43 (exact multiples: 20.02px, 22.88px, 31.46px).

## 3. Accessibility & Keyboard Navigation
- All overlays (Photo Tour, Lightbox, Amenities Modal) must have `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"`, and accessible labels.
- Modals must trap focus while open and return focus to the trigger on close.
- Lightbox must support Escape, ArrowLeft, and ArrowRight.
- Ensure 0 axe-core accessibility violations.

## 4. Testing & Verification
- Verify changes with `npm run check` (typecheck + lint + production build + e2e tests).
- Isolated component development occurs in `/dev/<section>` sandbox routes.
